  "notes": "USAGE: {判別|はんべつ} focuses on the cognitive or technical process of telling things apart. It often appears in scientific, medical, and technical writing.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {判別|はんべつ}する: to distinguish, to discriminate\n- {判別|はんべつ}が{難|むずか}しい: hard to tell apart\n- {判別|はんべつ}がつく / つかない: to be able / unable to distinguish\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {区別|くべつ}: distinction based on categories or classification\n- {判別|はんべつ}: perceptual or analytical discrimination between similar things\n- {識別|しきべつ}: identification, recognition (often technical)",
